{"id":"661549","name":"京酱肉丝","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661549/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪里脊","amount":"一根"}],"sub":[{"name":"大葱白","amount":"一段"},{"name":"干豆皮","amount":"2张"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料准备齐全。","img":"images/661549/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"里脊切丝。","img":"images/661549/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"白胡椒粉淀粉生抽一个鸡蛋清抓均匀，淹一会。","img":"images/661549/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大葱切丝，干豆皮切方块，摆盘中。","img":"images/661549/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"甜面酱加糖少量盐水，稀释一下。","img":"images/661549/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅底油，葱爆香，倒入肉丝炒变色，盛出盘中。","img":"images/661549/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再次起锅，热锅底油，下入甜面酱也炒粘稠，倒入肉丝。","img":"images/661549/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒出锅，摆拍。","img":"images/661549/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上桌。","img":"images/661549/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}